{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_04",
  "title": "驚愕",
  "storyCode": "LE-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "862bbd17b11ae6fdf53733ec37089013ae0e5c87cad5caa2194c03cffa2fe586",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g6_whitehome"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來了，來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......芙蓉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好......你起得好早啊，天剛剛亮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵？黑鍵還在睡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你眼睛好紅，難道是熬夜了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——把他也叫起來，趕快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假癒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我完全聽不懂你想說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是真的聽不懂，還是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，我再解釋一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來夕照區，是為了調查這裡感染者異常好轉的現象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但根據我們這幾天的走訪，夕照區的感染者並不是好轉，而是“假癒”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是說，病人的狀況看起來好轉了，實際上卻是在惡化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼明明惡化了，看起來還像是好轉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我這麼說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一般來說，身體受到損傷之後，最好的結局是“恢復原狀”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果做不到恢復原狀，身體就會調動沒受損的部分，去補償在損傷中失去的功能，我們一般稱為“代償”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在夕照區的大多數感染者，身體的代償功能都被異常調動起來，導致他們看起來狀態非常好，有的甚至和健康人看不出區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，在看不見的地方，在體內，礦石病的感染程度正在快速加深......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照現在的速度，即將有一批人進展到失代償階段了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失代償？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "損傷的程度超出了身體最大的代償能力，脆弱的平衡被打破，患者進入礦石病的急性發作期，病情急轉直下，危及生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事實上，已經有人進入急性發作期了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白你的意思了，但這和我們有什麼關係——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，難道說白堊也危險了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問題不在這，根據對調查結果的分析......你和白堊，似乎是引發這一切的主要因素。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和白堊是引發這一切的主要因素？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼夢話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在分析了你們的行動軌跡之後，我可以確定，你們......或者你們攜帶著的什麼東西，與假癒現象的發生有著極強的相關性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如你們住所隔壁洗衣店的女工，前天還說自己“感覺特別好”，昨天夜裡病情惡化，差點被送進感染者臨終事務處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在懇請你們配合，如果有任何線索，請立刻告訴我！這是為了夕照區所有人的生命安全著想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵&白堊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全想不起來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實想不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以防萬一，你們兩人跟我去一趟辦事處，讓我檢查一下，可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g4_embassy"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從指標上看，一個是再正常不過的健康人，一個是穩定期的礦石病患者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這怎麼可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，這次是夕照廳後面樂器店的老闆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——情況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好，老闆和高庭區的醫院簽過協議，人已經被接走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是假癒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，他昨天下午報告的是“沒有任何不適”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去跟進一下，免得醫院方面在協議上耍手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們倆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有我呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再問一遍，你們有任何能想到的線索嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在時間就是生命，拜託了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣，黑鍵，你先出來，我們單獨聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，你在屋裡等一會兒，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "單獨把我叫出來是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有誤判的地方我很抱歉，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望你和白堊立刻在空間上分開，越快越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼找我，不找他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你懷疑所謂的“假癒”是我故意所為？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實很希望你就是整件事的罪魁禍首，這樣我就可以直接把你交給維謝海姆的治安官，從根源上解決問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但假癒現象在你到來之前就已經開始，並且被行板注意到了，否則我也不會來維謝海姆，來夕照區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你憑什麼說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下，在我來之前？那白堊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假癒現象的出現......就在他來維謝海姆之後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在他來維謝海姆之後......怎麼會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾乎就是白堊來到夕照區的同時，一部分感染者的指標就開始緩緩變好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他那時對感染者的影響很微弱，除了細心的行板，沒人發現這一現象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到你們在報名會上相遇之後，白堊的影響陡然增強了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照之前行板發回給羅德島本艦的報告，如果只有白堊，情況惡化到現在這種程度，至少要半年時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你來了之後，短短幾天時間，就......變成了現在這個樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要你向我解釋這到底是怎麼回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不能解釋，至少也要在情況變得不可收拾之前踩下刹車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我希望你能儘快離開夕照區，離開維謝海姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音樂會呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音樂會——說什麼傻話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如假癒現象是由某種法術引起的，你們的合奏會有很大機率將其增強——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說......這就是你的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實話實說，我非常討厭這種無端受到懷疑的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是你說討厭就能解決的問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，給我一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多長時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快的話幾個小時，慢的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道，但我保證會來找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我相信你一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g4_embassy"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——我不同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵好不容易才獲得了參加音樂會的資格，好不容易才得到了車爾尼先生的認可......在這種時候半途而廢，實在太可惜了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是認可不認可的問題，是人命關天的大事啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵，你要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看起來氣喘吁吁，難道是一路跑來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不推薦您用這種方式來找我，暴露的可能性——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴露？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今，您還談什麼暴露？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我問您，您所謂的塵世之音的共振，會不會對其他人造成影響？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "共振？不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要不是刻意驅使，塵世之音的共振不會對人產生任何影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那為什麼芙蓉把我和白堊當成假癒現象的源頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島來維謝海姆出差的幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島把這種現象稱為“假癒”？不愧是專業人士，精準而簡潔的描述方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您......果然知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您說的是最近發生在夕照區的感染者身上的異常現象，我確實知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一言以蔽之，白堊體內的塵世之音是損壞的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "損壞的？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在您施展法術時，體內的塵世之音會被啟動，為您提供幫助，沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，我確實會在施術時隱約聽見一段刺耳的旋律，但這種東西怎麼可能損壞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊的塵世之音一直處在異常啟動的狀態，不存在如您現在一般“關閉”的狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "換句話說，他一直在不自覺地向周圍施術，而他自己無法控制這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你去問他，他很可能會說，他一直都能隱約聽見某種旋律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您可以將這種現象理解為“洩漏”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所謂“假癒”，就是他的塵世之音洩漏的後果——無差別地提高周圍的源石活性，利用源石的能量“治癒”周圍的感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過，用以治癒感染者的能量之源，是感染者自己體內的源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以感染者自己為法術裝置，以他們體內的源石為能源，增進他們的代償功能......這就是白堊的塵世之音引發的“假癒”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概從很久以前，白堊就一直保持著這樣的狀態，一直在影響著周圍的感染者了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果一直都是這樣，他的異常早就應該被人發現了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是您的功勞了，黑鍵先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "共振。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......共振增強了白堊塵世之音的洩漏，所以假癒現象才會在這幾天集中爆發？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全正確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我完全明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我退出您的這場計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您就這麼放棄了唾手可得的自由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒瘋到用一整個地塊的感染者換自由的地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您被羅德島的人嚇住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假癒確實談不上是好事，但您和白堊的音樂會幾天後就要舉行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到這幾天過去，您的塵世之音被除掉，然後再離開維謝海姆，也不會多死幾個感染者的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的機會千載難逢，您現在走了，烏提卡伯爵這個身份就將跟您一輩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您真的想這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不想，但我不能那麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見，格特魯德女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟您無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的腳步不是很穩。頭痛發作了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經說過了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟你無關！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
